      "state": "translated",
      "text": ":: You added information\n:: about the mission\n:: ^0000FF{0} Hunting^000000\n:: on the mission board.\n:: You've got a\n:: salutary experience.",
      "translation": "::您已将^0000FF{0}狩猎^000000任务\n::的信息登记到任务板上。\n::您获得了宝贵的经验。"
